    "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate experienced a significant strengthening of prior year reserves amounting to $48.466 million in 2018. This adverse development was primarily driven by higher than expected claims in the Non-Marine Liability class ($26.6 million), Property D&F ($13.2 million), and Specie & Cargo ($4.9 million). The strengthening also included recalibration of IBNR reserves for the 2015 and 2016 underwriting years, particularly in Non-Marine Liability, and higher attritional loss experience in Property D&F affecting prior periods.",
