      "$26.6m of this claims development affected the Non-Marine Liability class",
      "$13.2m from Property D&F",
      "$4.9m from Specie & Cargo",
      "Given the loss notifications in the Non-Marine Liability account for the 2015 and 2016 years of account, the reserves for claims incurred but not reported for the 2016, 2017 and 2018 years have also been strengthened.",
      "The Property D&F account has also been impacted by higher than expected attritional loss experience, affecting both the current and prior accident periods.",
      "Further in 2018 a strengthening of Non-Marine Liability reserves was recognised on the 2015 underwriting year."
